              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Peter Gorman"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great salsa! For those looking for a little more heat, I substituted a habenero pepper instead of the jalepeno (DO NOT use more than one). I also grilled the fresh pineapple slices and the red onion before dicing them and tossing them into the mixture. Once chilled, it got rave reviews at our Cinco de Mayo party.",
